- `assets/plots/klasyfikacja-pojazdow-mstar-onnx-inference-1.png` — confusion matrix; plotImage `sourceCode` reproduces it byte-for-byte (verified via SHA-256)
**Sources (6, all stable):** Chen 2016 (TGRS paper), MSTAR SDMS/AFRL, Novak 1997 (MIT Lincoln Lab paper), ONNX Runtime Web docs, Oliver & Quegan textbook, scikit-learn `confusion_matrix` docs.
